OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic nurdles wash up on beaches
OL,4,A30 miles away
OL,5,
OL,6,FNurdles are washing up on beaches more
OL,7,Fthan 30 miles (48km) south of the
OL,8,Fsource of a spillage of millions of
OL,9,Fplastic pellets.
OL,11,FTonnes of the pieces of plastic, known
OL,12,Fas nurdles, washed up across north-east
OL,13,FEngland after a crash between two
OL,14,Fvessels at the Port of Tyne damaged two
OL,15,Fshipping containers.
OL,17,FThe nurdles have now been spotted on
OL,18,Fbeaches in North Yorkshire and
OL,19,FTeesside, and volunteers are worried
OL,20,Fthe clean-up effort is being "left to
OL,21,Fcommunities" and called for a
OL,22,F"long-term plan".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
