OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic nurdles wash up on beaches
OL,4,A30 miles away
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Port of Tyne said its response had
OL,7,Fnot been "scaled back" and it continued
OL,8,Fto maintain the same level of on-water
OL,9,Fresource as throughout the clean-up
OL,10,Foperation.
